      ],
      "text": "Session continuity is persisted in `.super-dev/SESSION_BRIEF.md` and `.super-dev/workflow-state.json` (current action, host first-sentence, machine-side actions, continuity rules), and recovery from `.super-dev/` and `output/` artifacts is the default scenario after interruption."
    },
